@host = http://localhost:5117

### 1. Create a task — minimal body, Priority omitted → defaults to Medium (expect 201)
# @name create
POST {{host}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Buy milk"
}

### 2. Create a task — explicit priority (expect 201)
# @name createHigh
POST {{host}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ship release",
  "priority": "High"
}

### 3. Get all tasks (expect 200 + array)
GET {{host}}/tasks

### 4. Complete the first task (expect 200, CompletedAt set)
PUT {{host}}/tasks/{{create.response.body.id}}/complete

### 5. Complete it again — already completed (expect 409)
PUT {{host}}/tasks/{{create.response.body.id}}/complete

### 6. Complete a non-existent task (expect 404)
PUT {{host}}/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/complete

### 7. Delete the second task (expect 204)
DELETE {{host}}/tasks/{{createHigh.response.body.id}}

### 8. Delete the same task again (expect 404)
DELETE {{host}}/tasks/{{createHigh.response.body.id}}

### --- Negative: validation ---

### 9. Empty title (expect 400 ValidationProblem)
POST {{host}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": ""
}

### 10. Whitespace-only title (expect 400 ValidationProblem)
POST {{host}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "   "
}

### 11. Missing title field (expect 400 ValidationProblem)
POST {{host}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "priority": "Low"
}

### 12. Title of 201 chars (expect 400 ValidationProblem)
POST {{host}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"
}

### 13. Unknown enum string "Urgent" (expect 400 — fails at JSON binding)
POST {{host}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Weird priority",
  "priority": "Urgent"
}

### 14. Out-of-range numeric enum 99 (expect 400 — Enum.IsDefined check)
POST {{host}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Numeric priority",
  "priority": 99
}

### 15. Malformed JSON (expect 400, not 500 — StatusCodeSelector)
POST {{host}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "broken"

### 16. Invalid GUID in route (expect 404 — route constraint {id:guid} does not match)
PUT {{host}}/tasks/not-a-guid/complete
